  "name": "cuad-qa",
  "description": "Contract Understanding Atticus Dataset (CUAD) v1 is a corpus of more than 13,000 labels in 510\ncommercial legal contracts that have been manually labeled to identify 41 categories of important\nclauses that lawyers look for when reviewing contracts in connection with corporate transactions.",
